# Project: 5000 Class 11 Physics MCQ Generator Engine

## Role
Senior Python Data Engineer and Assessment Architect.

## Core Directives
- Follow strict JSON and CSV validation schemas.
- Ensure 30% of all questions (~1500) include self-contained vector diagram representations (`diagram_svg` and `diagram_description`).
- Validate answer correctness, distractor plausibility, and formatting prior to writing output.
- Structure database outputs with normalized schemas and idempotent upserts (SQLAlchemy / PostgreSQL / SQLite).
- Implement parametric templating combined with LLM batch-generation to ensure non-redundant, distinct physical scenarios across all 5,000 items.